sentences.t:
Tum sine sorte prior quae se certare professa est,
bella canit superum, falsoque in honore Gigantas
ponit et extenuat magnorum facta deorum;

sentences.l:
Then, without a lot, first, she who had declared herself to compete
sings the wars of the gods above, and in false honour the Giants
sets, and makes thin the deeds of the great gods;
